WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.167
Provenance you can verify.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.109
Every building block is pinned by its checksum, plus a signed note from the publisher.

3
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.855
Your browser verifies the signature itself, using WebAssembly.

4
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.541
Whatever you type is treated as data, never as instructions.

5
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.181
The result carries a fingerprint of the template and your inputs.

6
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.598
If the template is altered, the signature breaks. Verify, don't trust.
